#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:1 313a2eb437fd4b1692d15a1f7619f306
msgid "数据流详解"
msgstr "Data flow in detail"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:3 eeef6d5109314c41ad3bb1976a7a35c0
msgid ""
"从命令行参数到模型输出的端到端数据流：CLI 解析 → 数据加载 → 训练循环 → 评估 → 输出。本文基于 UniKT "
"源码，所有代码引用可追溯到具体文件和行号。"
msgstr ""
"The end-to-end data flow from CLI arguments to model output: CLI parsing "
"→ data loading → training loop → evaluation → output. This document is "
"based on the UniKT source; every code reference is traceable to a "
"specific file and line number."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:5 c6adc8b980d94ebc97d0ce1f4fcd1906
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:23 e4e54d2337f74eebb833137fae8271b8
msgid "CLI 入口层"
msgstr "CLI entry layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:25 6c30fd2ad0df4817963cef337de0396b
msgid ""
"训练入口通常为项目根目录的 ``train.py``（或 ``optuna_search.py`` "
"用于超参数搜索，``case_analysis.py`` 用于案例分析）。以标准训练为例，用户执行："
msgstr ""
"The training entry point is usually ``train.py`` in the project root (or "
"``optuna_search.py`` for hyperparameter search, ``case_analysis.py`` for "
"case analysis). For a standard training run, the user executes:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:31 ac6fa15137ee427aa05ede4dee3f38fe
msgid "参数解析流程"
msgstr "Argument parsing flow"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:33 7f76060b11a04eddafb34b690a401610
msgid "命令行参数由两层构成：**通用参数组**（无条件加载）和**模型专属参数组**（按 ``-m`` 指定的模型动态注入）。"
msgstr ""
"CLI arguments consist of two layers: **general parameter groups** (loaded"
" unconditionally) and a **model-specific parameter group** (dynamically "
"injected based on the model specified by ``-m``)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:52 3b02f2a7b08b4f379173f9ac0d8e0af7
msgid "通用参数组定义在 ``utils/config/param_config.py``："
msgstr ""
"The general parameter groups are defined in "
"``utils/config/param_config.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:54 075e286535f94f24a3eac5552a8cd548
msgid ""
"**DataParams**（）：``--dataset``、``--fold``、``--kfold``、``--max_seq_len``、``--data_base_path``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**DataParams** (): ``--dataset``, ``--fold``, ``--kfold``, "
"``--max_seq_len``, ``--data_base_path``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:55 8699a83ef2774cf6b194d7877a9b5816
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**GeneralParams**（）：``--device``、``--seed``、``--log_dir``、``--no_swanlab``、``--no_deterministic``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**GeneralParams** (): ``--device``, ``--seed``, ``--log_dir``, "
"``--no_swanlab``, ``--deterministic``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:56 5c5602e5af4749dc96a686dae551f8ad
msgid "**EarlyStoppingParams**（）：``--es_monitor``、``--es_mode``、``--es_patience``、``--es_min_delta``"
msgstr ""
"**EarlyStoppingParams** (): ``--es_monitor``, ``--es_mode``, "
"``--es_patience``, ``--es_min_delta``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:57 5d41c96d5f1f491a95a54752ab8c8238
msgid ""
"**CompileParams**（）：``--compile``、``--compile_mode``、``--compile_backend``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**CompileParams** (): ``--compile``, ``--compile_mode``, "
"``--compile_backend``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:58 c9c9902f11b549d9a8e0bf38b6473b8c
msgid "**SamplingParams**（）：``--sample_size``、``--sample_strategy`` 等"
msgstr "**SamplingParams** (): ``--sample_size``, ``--sample_strategy``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:60 fb254a20aaa4461ab3e6cdf2b86b9adb
msgid ""
"每个参数组都是 ``BaseParamConfig`` 的子类，通过 ``define_params`` "
"方法定义参数规范（类型、默认值、帮助文本），由 ``add_args(parser)`` 类方法注入到 "
"``argparse.ArgumentParser``。``bool`` 类型自动映射为 ``store_true`` 或 "
"``store_false`` action（``param_config.py`` ）。"
msgstr ""
"Each parameter group is a subclass of ``BaseParamConfig`` that defines "
"the parameter spec (type, default, help text) via the ``define_params`` "
"method, and is injected into ``argparse.ArgumentParser`` by the "
"``add_args(parser)`` classmethod. ``bool`` types are automatically mapped"
" to the ``store_true`` or ``store_false`` action (``param_config.py``)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:62 f3686bb14310477884acf0cade53d32f
msgid "模型专属参数以 GIKT 为例，在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` 中："
msgstr ""
"Taking GIKT as an example, the model-specific parameters live in "
"``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:99 fc2c9fafb4c348fdb897498d9ff32b82
msgid ""
"``train.py`` 先加载通用参数组，再根据 ``-m`` 指定的模型名从已注册参数中获取对应参数类并调用 "
"``add_args(parser)``，实现**通用参数 + 模型参数**的分层解析。"
msgstr ""
"``train.py`` first loads the general parameter groups, then looks up the "
"registered parameter class for the model specified by ``-m`` and calls "
"``add_args(parser)``, achieving the layered parsing of **general "
"parameters + model parameters**."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:101 7d1d5078b0db4abd97c41c0f14829c01
msgid "数据加载层"
msgstr "Data loading layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:103 bb60798ab5ef4f9e82638d7fec977a0d
msgid "数据流进入模型训练器之前需要经过两步数据准备：**原始数据加载与清洗**（DataSource）和**模型级数据切分与构造**（ModelData）。"
msgstr ""
"Before the data flow reaches the model trainer, it goes through two "
"preparation steps: **raw data loading and cleaning** (DataSource) and "
"**model-level data splitting and construction** (ModelData)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:105 ceb4fe22076f45d89276d56d9dfa5d2f
msgid "第一步：DataSource 管线"
msgstr "Step 1: DataSource pipeline"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:107 a14c199171b442fc8797d3c540ca0a96
msgid ""
"数据源系统由 ``utils/data_process/`` 包实现，管线在 ``DataSource`` "
"基类（``data_source.py`` ）中定义："
msgstr ""
"The data-source system is implemented by the ``utils/data_process/`` "
"package; the pipeline is defined in the ``DataSource`` base class "
"(``data_source.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:113 7b105db09ce94824881d94aba8d7c287
msgid "每个步骤的作用："
msgstr "The role of each step:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:115 a5f063a393cc48868cbd501449c56d70
msgid "``load_src_data``（）：从磁盘加载原始数据（CSV、Parquet 或自定义格式），**抽象方法，每个数据集自行实现**"
msgstr ""
"``load_src_data`` (): loads raw data from disk (CSV, Parquet, or a custom"
" format); **abstract method, implemented per dataset**"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:116 99890422a5974073a4668a7a7a9350e8
msgid "``clean_raw_data``（）：去除无效记录、统一列名、处理缺失值"
msgstr ""
"``clean_raw_data`` (): removes invalid records, unifies column names, "
"handles missing values"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:117 3a92b41db81d43329b4104c8428677f5
msgid "``transform_data``（）：转换为标准格式，产出 5 类数据："
msgstr ""
"``transform_data`` (): converts to the standard format and produces 5 "
"kinds of data:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:118 0f46df5edc8e4beab84f0629ebe12082
msgid "``sequence_data``：用户交互序列（user / question / label / timestamp）"
msgstr ""
"``sequence_data``: user interaction sequences (user / question / label / "
"timestamp)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:119 60297458e7e44d14aa332827f35f7339
msgid "``split_question_sequence``：按知识点切分后的问题级序列"
msgstr ""
"``split_question_sequence``: question-level sequences split by knowledge "
"concept"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:120 58b65935bb164435ae4c451c831e73a2
msgid "``split_skill_sequence``：按知识点切分后的技能级序列"
msgstr "``split_skill_sequence``: skill-level sequences split by knowledge concept"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:121 8ca2400d2c7e4b9ca506763fcc129b47
msgid "``windowlate_data``：滑动窗口评估数据"
msgstr "``windowlate_data``: sliding-window evaluation data"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:122 e6d1a907bd4c4f45bab259fa970008d0
msgid "``relation_data/*``：关系表家族（``question_skill``、``question_assignment``、``question_template``）"
msgstr ""
"``relation_data/*``: the relation-table family (``question_skill``, "
"``question_assignment``, ``question_template``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:123 79f74004e0c6436d8b1808e35fa68e75
msgid "``save_data``（）：保存为 Parquet 并执行数据一致性校验（MD5 哈希、question_id 交叉校验、列检查）"
msgstr ""
"``save_data`` (): saves to Parquet and runs data consistency checks (MD5 "
"hash, question_id cross-check, column checks)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:125 35f3813324b2410aa4f9786b5868d78c
msgid ""
"**注意：** UniKT 全链路使用 **Polars** DataFrame 和 Parquet 格式，不使用 pandas。与 pandas"
" 最大的差异是 Polars 没有行索引，所有数据操作通过列名和表达式完成。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** UniKT uses **Polars** DataFrames and the Parquet format end to "
"end, not pandas. The biggest difference from pandas is that Polars has no"
" row index; all data operations are done via column names and "
"expressions."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:127 49884a91a9fc49e2a0346af0f74c2123
msgid ""
"数据集通过 ``@register_data_source`` 装饰器注册到 ``DATA_SOURCES`` 全局表。导入 "
"``utils.data_process`` 时触发 AST 静态发现（``__init__.py`` ），扫描 "
"``data_process/`` 下所有 ``.py`` 的 ``@register_data_source(\"数据集名\")`` "
"装饰器，建立懒索引。"
msgstr ""
"Datasets are registered into the ``DATA_SOURCES`` global registry via the"
" ``@register_data_source`` decorator. Importing ``utils.data_process`` "
"triggers AST static discovery (``__init__.py``), which scans all ``.py`` "
"files under ``data_process/`` for "
"``@register_data_source(\"dataset_name\")`` decorators and builds a lazy "
"index."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:129 dc1b5d29de534c47b133e57858448ce0
msgid "使用时通过工厂函数获取："
msgstr "At use time, get an instance via a factory function:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:137 b022c62e320449829b2df331668d13b6
msgid "``get_data_source``（``__init__.py`` ）内部查找已注册的数据源并实例化。"
msgstr ""
"``get_data_source`` (``__init__.py``) looks up the registered data source"
" and instantiates it."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:139 9d0671f6d566482eb6a12a636f2a97c3
msgid ""
"当前支持 11 "
"个数据集：``algebra2005``、``algebra2006``、``assistments09/12/15/17``、``bridge2006``、``ednet_kt1``、``junyi2015``、``nips2020_t34``、``slepemapy``。"
msgstr ""
"Currently 11 datasets are supported: ``algebra2005``, ``algebra2006``, "
"``assistments09/12/15/17``, ``bridge2006``, ``ednet_kt1``, ``junyi2015``,"
" ``nips2020_t34``, ``slepemapy``."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:141 1d17f77f689343079f631077f18c7bbb
msgid "第二步：ModelData 准备"
msgstr "Step 2: ModelData preparation"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:143 39ba44d3fdf746c8bc8c18a9530032f7
msgid ""
"DataSource 产出的是原始交互序列，ModelData 负责将其转换为模型可消费的训练/验证/测试张量。基类 "
"``BaseModelData``（``utils/model_data/base_model_data.py`` ）提供以下通用能力："
msgstr ""
"DataSource produces raw interaction sequences; ModelData converts them "
"into train/val/test tensors that the model can consume. The base class "
"``BaseModelData`` (``utils/model_data/base_model_data.py``) provides the "
"following general capabilities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:145 897d17182a52404b8aca422c0ff0b3da
msgid "``prepare_data(args)``：**抽象方法**，每个模型子类实现，是数据准备的入口"
msgstr ""
"``prepare_data(args)``: **abstract method**, implemented by each model "
"subclass; the entry point of data preparation"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:146 a088104b41fa4012a2a2e765bf83deeb
msgid ""
"``split_kfold_data(*arrays, fold_idx)``（）：基于用户级别的 K-fold 划分，同一个用户的所有交互不会跨"
" fold"
msgstr ""
"``split_kfold_data(*arrays, fold_idx)`` (): user-level K-fold split; all "
"interactions of a single user never cross folds"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:147 d38778e12cf548b1bb97763e54e43505
msgid "``split_data(*arrays, val_ratio, test_ratio)``（）：随机划分（非 K-fold 模式）"
msgstr ""
"``split_data(*arrays, val_ratio, test_ratio)`` (): random split "
"(non-K-fold mode)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:148 3760d63c69774f1db161c643eb8ad125
msgid "``calculate_question_difficulty(exclude_fold)``（）：使用正确率 × 置信度 + 回归均值计算题目难度"
msgstr ""
"``calculate_question_difficulty(exclude_fold)`` (): computes question "
"difficulty using accuracy × confidence + regression mean"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:149 3a3da46c7ee3473cb1ece23d39d84783
msgid "``build_relationship_matrix(edge_type)``（）：构建二值或计数关系矩阵（用于图模型）"
msgstr ""
"``build_relationship_matrix(edge_type)`` (): builds a binary or count "
"relation matrix (for graph models)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:150 0fa038350e2c4f0eae35b0101d54fe0f
msgid "``disk_cache``（）：基于 pickle 的磁盘缓存装饰器，通过 ``--cache`` 启用"
msgstr ""
"``disk_cache`` (): a pickle-based disk cache decorator, enabled via "
"``--cache``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:152 c0874ce9b6574aa5a9a5cfbd64fcc083
msgid "UniKT 提供两个平行的 ModelData 分支，服务不同粒度的模型："
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides two parallel ModelData branches serving models of "
"different granularities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:154 2eb35e899d784028b22a67cb557bfdf6
msgid "**SkillModelData — KC 级模型**（``utils/model_data/skill_model_data.py`` L1）"
msgstr ""
"**SkillModelData — KC-level models** "
"(``utils/model_data/skill_model_data.py`` L1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:156 393482aabce9469a960d283f46bdd330
msgid ""
"面向需要技能（Knowledge Component）序列的模型（如 DKT、GIKT）。``build_sequence_data``（）从 "
"``data_src.get_split_skill_sequence_data`` 构建技能序列，产出 5 个等长数组（shape 均为 "
"``[num_users, max_seq_len]``）："
msgstr ""
"For models that need a skill (Knowledge Component) sequence (e.g. DKT, "
"GIKT). ``build_sequence_data`` () builds the skill sequence from "
"``data_src.get_split_skill_sequence_data`` and produces 5 equal-length "
"arrays (each with shape ``[num_users, max_seq_len]``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:158 f75d613e27f4410cb79cc09b7898d845
msgid "``user_sequence``：技能（KC）ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_sequence``: skill (KC) ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:159 31a8062bd34c428abfeb89e4bf9dda37
msgid "``user_response``：作答正误（0/1）"
msgstr "``user_response``: response correctness (0/1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:160 4885ab2a50de4e0ab07e4e472674be54
msgid "``user_mask``：有效位置掩码（padding 位置为 0）"
msgstr "``user_mask``: valid-position mask (0 at padding positions)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:161 2f7f0c84a6014cbb9fa14cca071dfe43
msgid "``user_id_sequence``：用户 ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_id_sequence``: user ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:162 3926d8ceb201433dad8e2fd4ac3dca7f
msgid "``user_question``：题目 ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_question``: question ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:183 f724f94451a245079854a95d089d1d18
msgid ""
"**QuestionModelData — Question "
"级模型**（``utils/model_data/question_model_data.py`` L1）"
msgstr ""
"**QuestionModelData — Question-level models** "
"(``utils/model_data/question_model_data.py`` L1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:185 90d815d3299e4cbfbb3582476875107a
msgid ""
"面向需要题目级交互图和异构图数据的模型（如 HDHKT、GIKT 图分支）。``load_sequence_data``（）从 "
"``data_src.get_split_question_sequence_data`` 构建题目序列，产出 4 个数组。额外提供图构建能力："
msgstr ""
"For models that need question-level interaction graphs and heterogeneous "
"graph data (e.g. HDHKT, the GIKT graph branch). ``load_sequence_data`` ()"
" builds the question sequence from "
"``data_src.get_split_question_sequence_data`` and produces 4 arrays. It "
"additionally provides graph-construction capabilities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:187 945236f1468c4444b00cfca6141267e3
msgid ""
"``build_hetero_graph(edge_types, edge_attrs, directed, "
"node_features)``（）：构建 PyTorch Geometric ``HeteroData``"
msgstr ""
"``build_hetero_graph(edge_types, edge_attrs, directed, node_features)`` "
"(): builds a PyTorch Geometric ``HeteroData``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:188 890c6a650595420e986b32ea3580459e
msgid "``build_hyper_graph(edge_type, vertex_type)``（）：构建 DHG ``Hypergraph``"
msgstr ""
"``build_hyper_graph(edge_type, vertex_type)`` (): builds a DHG "
"``Hypergraph``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:190 e54b2e283c14440aa1643359a72109c2
msgid "**K-fold 划分机制**（``base_model_data.py`` ）："
msgstr "**K-fold splitting mechanism** (``base_model_data.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:201 d95d0b24a7464df1901dc5f8fa77ae84
msgid "划分是 **用户级别** 的——同一用户的所有交互序列完整落入一个 fold，避免数据泄露。这个设计保证验证集和测试集中的用户是训练阶段从未见过的。"
msgstr ""
"The split is **user-level** — all interaction sequences of the same user "
"fall entirely into one fold, preventing data leakage. This design "
"guarantees that users in the validation and test sets were never seen "
"during training."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:203 be8eee7270ed43ddb57e081dd38ea3b3
msgid "训练循环层"
msgstr "Training loop layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:205 51640104aa78425c92b3f0b9efb4ab6c
msgid "训练器构建：链式 Builder 模式"
msgstr "Trainer construction: chained Builder pattern"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:207 051a6f373dd4421db23cfb2cb866a3c8
msgid ""
"每个模型训练器（例如 ``GIKTTrainer`` 在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` ）在 "
"``__init__`` 中通过链式调用构建训练环境："
msgstr ""
"Each model trainer (e.g. ``GIKTTrainer`` in "
"``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``) builds the training environment via "
"chained calls inside ``__init__``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:237 8ba37bd427674026b42bcf033d356e4c
msgid ""
"``build`` 方法（``base_trainer.py`` ）负责验证 4 个配置块必须全部设置、创建 "
"DataLoader、初始化回调链、设置随机种子、创建指标累积器。之后调用 ``run`` 启动训练。"
msgstr ""
"The ``build`` method (``base_trainer.py``) verifies that all 4 config "
"blocks are set, creates the DataLoader, initializes the callback chain, "
"sets the random seed, and creates the metric accumulator. It then calls "
"``run`` to start training."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:239 47053252f50442fc80aecb9d23376c9f
msgid "训练循环核心"
msgstr "Training loop core"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:241 10a70a3196c9425b8997ec52ada02e38
msgid "训练循环在 ``_run_training_loop``（``base_trainer.py`` ）中实现："
msgstr ""
"The training loop is implemented in ``_run_training_loop`` "
"(``base_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:269 291819615e3046d98d1a696d1a7d62dd
msgid ""
"训练批次（``_run_train_batch``，）和验证批次（``_run_eval_batch``，）的核心区别：训练批次执行 "
"``opt.zero_grad → backward → clip_grad → opt.step`` 完整的梯度更新；验证批次用 "
"``@torch.inference_mode`` 禁用梯度计算，只做前向传播和损失计算。"
msgstr ""
"The key difference between a training batch (``_run_train_batch``,) and a"
" validation batch (``_run_eval_batch``,): the training batch runs the "
"full gradient update ``opt.zero_grad → backward → clip_grad → opt.step``;"
" the validation batch uses ``@torch.inference_mode`` to disable gradient "
"computation and only does the forward pass and loss computation."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:271 e98e78d25dea48b1b24c533bbf49c552
msgid "forward_pass 约定"
msgstr "forward_pass contract"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:273 61d00f59c0cb49afb54022c266709581
msgid ""
"每个训练器子类必须实现 ``forward_pass(batch_data) → dict``（``base_trainer.py`` "
"，抽象方法）。返回值字典必须包含三个键："
msgstr ""
"Each trainer subclass must implement ``forward_pass(batch_data) → dict`` "
"(``base_trainer.py``, abstract method). The returned dict must contain "
"three keys:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:283 fd387ddcc5ad4ee0bfcda9831bb8dbc3
msgid "可选扩展键：``\"y_score\"``（原始得分）、``\"y_prob\"``（sigmoid 概率）。"
msgstr ""
"Optional extension keys: ``\"y_score\"`` (raw score), ``\"y_prob\"`` "
"(sigmoid probability)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:285 71ce33294daa477da67b137c77bef66e
msgid ""
"**Next-item 对齐约定**（``base_trainer.py`` ）：``y_hat_full[t]`` 预测 "
"``response[t+1]``。``_extract_valid_predictions`` 提取 ``y_hat_full[:,:-1]``"
" 与 ``response[:,1:]`` 的对齐，掩码同样取相邻位置的交集 ``mask[:,:-1] & "
"mask[:,1:]``。部分模型输出 ``[B, S-1]``（比输入少一位），通过 "
"``_pad_to_full_sequence``（）在前端补零对齐。"
msgstr ""
"**Next-item alignment convention** (``base_trainer.py``): "
"``y_hat_full[t]`` predicts ``response[t+1]``. "
"``_extract_valid_predictions`` extracts the alignment of "
"``y_hat_full[:,:-1]`` with ``response[:,1:]``; the mask likewise takes "
"the intersection of adjacent positions ``mask[:,:-1] & mask[:,1:]``. Some"
" models output ``[B, S-1]`` (one element shorter than the input); "
"``_pad_to_full_sequence`` () zero-pads the front to align."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:287 4ca19ea45f464934a78c62e2385c4fac
msgid "以 GIKT 的 ``forward_pass`` 为例（``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` ）："
msgstr ""
"Using GIKT's ``forward_pass`` as an example "
"(``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:317 05d545d659e144be954f9b8e61c3166b
msgid "评估层"
msgstr "Evaluation layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:319 de0a996038714465b84037ce5611945b
msgid ""
"每个 epoch "
"结束后，训练循环自动在验证集上评估指标。``MetricsAccumulator``（``utils/training/metrics.py``）在验证阶段收集所有"
" batch 的 ``y_hat`` 和 ``y_label``，在 phase 结束时聚合并计算："
msgstr ""
"After each epoch ends, the training loop automatically evaluates metrics "
"on the validation set. ``MetricsAccumulator`` "
"(``utils/training/metrics.py``) collects the ``y_hat`` and ``y_label`` of"
" every batch during the validation phase and aggregates them at the end "
"of the phase to compute:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:321 f2edc67130214bf3a0140955585d53b6
msgid "**AUC**（ROC 曲线下面积）"
msgstr "**AUC** (area under the ROC curve)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:322 fe31c583e3a543cda24a21cb353ea752
msgid "**ACC**（准确率）"
msgstr "**ACC** (accuracy)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:323 dcb3a17c33c44fe9b4dc5f8c66455901
msgid "**RMSE**（均方根误差）"
msgstr "**RMSE** (root mean squared error)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:325 d17fdabda43b452390e8b43cd128d11d
msgid ""
"训练完全结束后，``_evaluate_on_test_set``（``base_trainer.py`` "
"）在测试集上执行相同流程。如果启用了早停且 ``--es_restore_best``，评估使用验证集上最佳模型的权重。"
msgstr ""
"After training fully completes, ``_evaluate_on_test_set`` "
"(``base_trainer.py``) runs the same flow on the test set. If early "
"stopping is enabled and ``--es_restore_best`` is set, evaluation uses the"
" weights of the best model on the validation set."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:327 ea5bd087e9d04b9498a975b9be37ebed
msgid "输出层"
msgstr "Output layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:329 e6d696b8e4b14d5ebea4b8723ab15ed2
msgid "目录结构"
msgstr "Directory structure"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:331 8b6bb51a57b9474d85647a89aee16469
msgid ""
"训练结果保存在 ``runs/<type>/<run_id>/``，由 "
"``ExperimentManager``（``utils/experiment_manager.py``）创建。以正常训练为例："
msgstr ""
"Training results are saved under ``runs/<type>/<run_id>/``, created by "
"``ExperimentManager`` (``utils/experiment_manager.py``). Taking normal "
"training as an example:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:343 7cb8844915bb4fcaa3c7227f995e745e
msgid "指标记录"
msgstr "Metric logging"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:345 4715378c7ce0415d93b13fea006bb1fd
msgid ""
"UniKT 采用**双轨记录**：本地 CSV 始终记录（通过 "
"``LocalMetricLogger``，``utils/training/metric_logger.py``），SwanLab "
"云端记录可选（通过 ``SwanLabMetricLogger``），通过 ``--no_swanlab`` 关闭。训练期间每 epoch "
"记录一次聚合指标，若启用 ``--log_batch_metrics`` 则额外记录每个 batch 的损失。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT uses **dual-track logging**: local CSV is always recorded (via "
"``LocalMetricLogger``, ``utils/training/metric_logger.py``); SwanLab "
"cloud logging is optional (via ``SwanLabMetricLogger``) and can be turned"
" off with ``--no_swanlab``. During training, aggregate metrics are logged"
" once per epoch; if ``--log_batch_metrics`` is enabled, the per-batch "
"loss is also logged."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:347 449a6782f2a9490a957cdc9d88ce0fbf
msgid "回调系统输出"
msgstr "Callback system output"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:349 fc69ab4749be4c998a4eb845ab8885c1
msgid "``CallbackManager``（``utils/training/callbacks.py``）编排以下回调的输出："
msgstr ""
"``CallbackManager`` (``utils/training/callbacks.py``) orchestrates the "
"output of the following callbacks:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:351 8105ac31cbdb47a9959e750f0122608e
msgid "**CheckpointCallback**：按监控指标保存最佳模型权重和每个 epoch 的检查点"
msgstr ""
"**CheckpointCallback**: saves the best model weights by the monitored "
"metric and a checkpoint for each epoch"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:352 ea1ba1add6d445ef868b75740e8dbfea
msgid "**EarlyStoppingCallback**：当验证指标连续 ``patience`` 轮无改进时触发停止"
msgstr ""
"**EarlyStoppingCallback**: triggers a stop when the validation metric has"
" not improved for ``patience`` consecutive epochs"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:353 5edc4e5b09d74b1bb65c18391c25264d
msgid "**MemoryCleanupCallback**：每个 epoch 结束后清理 GPU 缓存"
msgstr "**MemoryCleanupCallback**: clears the GPU cache after each epoch"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:354 df36a64ca37949e3a8b9d04a26a8eafb
msgid "**TestEvaluationCallback**：训练完成后自动在测试集上评估"
msgstr ""
"**TestEvaluationCallback**: automatically evaluates on the test set after"
" training completes"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:356 bade5e18fdbe4270a3f3c84035eada12
msgid "端到端数据流总览"
msgstr "End-to-end data flow overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:358 f78dcff0f37943178c4bdb43911ac34f
msgid "将以上各层串联，一条 ``python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --fold 0`` 命令的完整数据流："
msgstr ""
"Chaining the above layers together, the complete data flow of a ``python "
"train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --fold 0`` command:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:408 2fe27f240db0440daa0660309acce3ed
msgid "多阶段训练的数据流"
msgstr "Data flow of multi-stage training"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:410 d003ea8ef71241a888cd77b714124f98
msgid ""
"``MultiTrainer``（``utils/training/multi_trainer.py`` "
"）在单阶段训练之上叠加了**阶段切换**机制。每个阶段拥有独立的模型、优化器、损失函数、数据和早停配置，通过 "
"``StageComponents`` dataclass 封装。"
msgstr ""
"``MultiTrainer`` (``utils/training/multi_trainer.py``) layers a **stage-"
"switching** mechanism on top of single-stage training. Each stage has its"
" own model, optimizer, loss function, data, and early-stopping config, "
"encapsulated by the ``StageComponents`` dataclass."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:424 0b68d53b0a5d4231a1bffe71568be6a8
msgid ""
"每个阶段调用 ``_run_training_loop`` 复用了 ``BaseTrainer`` 的核心训练逻辑，阶段之间的数据传递通过 "
"``on_stage_begin`` / ``on_stage_complete`` 钩子实现。例如 ABKT 模型在两个阶段（Knowledge"
" Mastery → Ability Modeling）之间传递知识状态矩阵。"
msgstr ""
"Each stage calls ``_run_training_loop``, reusing the core training logic "
"of ``BaseTrainer``; data passing between stages is done via the "
"``on_stage_begin`` / ``on_stage_complete`` hooks. For example, the ABKT "
"model passes the knowledge-state matrix between its two stages (Knowledge"
" Mastery → Ability Modeling)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:426 cb499fab2a1e49c2aadba9845e21aaf0
msgid "多阶段训练器在构造时接收 ``model=None``（``multi_trainer.py`` ），因为模型在各阶段内部动态构建："
msgstr ""
"The multi-stage trainer receives ``model=None`` at construction time "
"(``multi_trainer.py``), because the model is built dynamically inside "
"each stage:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:428 45a6b52daa254a5b89416a50b22bbd61
msgid ""
"``build_stages`` 返回 ``list[StageConfig]``，每个 ``StageConfig`` 通过 ``build``"
" 回调产出该阶段的 ``StageComponents``"
msgstr ""
"``build_stages`` returns ``list[StageConfig]``; each ``StageConfig`` "
"produces the ``StageComponents`` for that stage via a ``build`` callback"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:429 51182e4cce33431bb207675e05b379a8
msgid ""
"运行时通过 ``_apply_stage`` 切换 "
"``self.model``、``self.opt``、``self.loss``、``self.train_data``、``self.epochs``、``self.early_stopping``"
" 等属性"
msgstr ""
"At runtime, ``_apply_stage`` swaps attributes such as ``self.model``, "
"``self.opt``, ``self.loss``, ``self.train_data``, ``self.epochs``, "
"``self.early_stopping``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:430 32026cf5f95e4d62941bb8cd8cb06f60
msgid "``forward_pass`` 通过 ``self._current_stage`` 区分阶段，路由到不同的前向逻辑"
msgstr ""
"``forward_pass`` distinguishes stages via ``self._current_stage`` and "
"routes to different forward logic"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:432 628b0ed867234afdac368b0178690a31
msgid ""
"**注意：** ``BaseTrainer.build`` 必须先调 ``with_training`` / ``with_data`` / "
"``with_optimization`` / ``with_experiment`` 四个方法，否则 ``build`` 会抛 "
"``ValueError``。四个配置块分别对应 "
"``TrainingConfig``、``DataConfig``、``OptimizationConfig``、``ExperimentConfig``"
" dataclass（``utils/config/training_config.py``）。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** ``BaseTrainer.build`` must first call the four methods "
"``with_training`` / ``with_data`` / ``with_optimization`` / "
"``with_experiment``, otherwise ``build`` raises a ``ValueError``. The "
"four config blocks correspond respectively to the ``TrainingConfig``, "
"``DataConfig``, ``OptimizationConfig``, ``ExperimentConfig`` dataclasses "
"(``utils/config/training_config.py``)."

